"""Official Football Manager In-Game Term Localization Engine (21 Official `.ltc` Languages + `lang_db.dat`).

Allows any tool or UI (such as FM Studio) to display in-game Football Manager terms
(Player Technical/Mental/Physical/Goalkeeping/Hidden Attributes, 3-letter Abbreviations,
Staff Coaching/Scouting/Medical Attributes, Positions, Squad Statuses, Reputation & Contract
terms) in any of the **21 official FM languages** (`turkish`, `english`, `german`, `spanish`,
`french`, `italian`, `portuguese`, `dutch`, `polish`, `greek`, `russian`, `arabic`, `danish`,
`norwegian`, `swedish`, `indonesian`, `japanese`, `korean`, `chinese`, `english (us)`,
`spanish (latam)`), **completely independent of the UI interface language**.

For example, a user can use the Studio interface in English while viewing Player Attributes
(`Finishing` -> `Bitiricilik`, `Pace` -> `Hız`, `Off The Ball` -> `Topsuz Alan`,
`Vision` -> `Vizyon`) in Turkish, German, Spanish, Japanese, etc., or vice versa.

Also supports live extraction from `data/game_simulation/languages.fmf` (`*.ltc` string-ID
tables) and `data/database/db/<ver>/lang_db.dat` (localized entity names).
"""

from __future__ import annotations

import io
import re
import struct
from pathlib import Path
from typing import Any

import zstandard

from fm26save.formulas import read_fmf_directory

